{"id":"n6299c5f636","headline":"Philippines posts $2.6 billion balance of payment deficit in March","summary":"The Philippines' overall balance of payments was a $2.6 billion deficit in March, wider than the $2.3 billion deficit in the prior period. The balance of payments tracks the country's total external transactions.","why":"The balance of payments summarizes a country's trade, investment and financial flows with the rest of the world, and persistent deficits can pressure the local currency.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Manila","country":"Philippines","lat":14.6,"lon":120.984,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Interaksyon","url":"https://interaksyon.philstar.com/politics-issues/2026/04/21/312266/philippines-posts-2-6-billion-balance-of-payment-deficit-in-march/"},"sources":[{"name":"Interaksyon","url":"https://interaksyon.philstar.com/politics-issues/2026/04/21/312266/philippines-posts-2-6-billion-balance-of-payment-deficit-in-march/"}],"published_at":"2026-04-20T23:00:57Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:23Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"1b9bec9df8407477","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:23Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-04-20T23:00:57Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-04-21T00:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"RP","description_from":"publisher page metadata"}}